give @s written_book[written_book_content={pages:[["", {"text": "\n\n\n   BLOOD ON THE\n    CLOCKTOWER", "bold": true}, "\n", {"text": "  \"Shoot the Runner\"", "italic": true, "color": "gold"}, "\n", {"text": "ROLE CHEAT SHEET", "bold": true}, "\n\n\n\n* next to ability means Not the First Night."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Noble", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing 3 players, 1 and only 1 of which is evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Investigator", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Minion."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Librarian", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou start knowing that 1 of 2 players is a particular Outsider. (Or that zero are in play.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Empath", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn how many of your 2 alive neighbors are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Balloonist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, you learn a player of a different character type than last night. [+0 or +1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fortune Teller", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night, choose 2 players: you learn if either is a Demon. There is a good player that registers as a Demon to you."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Flowergirl", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn if a Demon voted today."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Oracle", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, you learn how many dead players are evil."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Acrobat", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: if they are or become drunk or poisoned tonight, you die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Exorcist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player (different to last night): the Demon, if chosen, learns who you are then doesn't wake tonight."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Slayer", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nOnce per game, during the day, publicly choose a player: if they are the Demon, they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Sage", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf the Demon kills you, you learn that it is 1 of 2 players."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TOWNSFOLK", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Pacifist", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nExecuted good players might not die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Drunk", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nYou do not know you are the Drunk. You think you are a Townsfolk character, but you are not."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Plague Doctor", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nWhen you die, the Storyteller gains a Minion ability."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Hatter", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you died today or tonight, the Minion & Demon players may choose new Minion & Demon characters to be."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "OUTSIDER", "bold": true, "color": "dark_blue"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Mutant", "color": "dark_blue", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_blue"}, "\nIf you are \u201cmad\u201d about being an Outsider, you might be executed."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Devil's Advocate", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night, choose a living player (different to last night): if executed tomorrow, they don't die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Goblin", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf you publicly claim to be the Goblin when nominated & are executed that day, your team wins."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scarlet Woman", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nIf there are 5 or more players alive & the Demon dies, you become the Demon. (Travellers don't count.)"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "MINION", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Boffin", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nThe Demon (even if drunk or poisoned) has a not-in-play good character\u2019s ability. You both know which."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Imp", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. If you kill yourself this way, a Minion becomes the Imp."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Fang Gu", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. The 1st Outsider this kills becomes an evil Fang Gu & you die instead. [+1 Outsider]"],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "DEMON", "bold": true, "color": "dark_red"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Lleech", "color": "dark_red", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "dark_red"}, "\nEach night*, choose a player: they die. You start by choosing a player: they are poisoned. You die if & only if they are dead."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Thief", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach night, choose a player (not yourself): their vote counts negatively tomorrow."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Gunslinger", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nEach day, after the 1st vote has been tallied, you may choose a player that voted: they die."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Bone Collector", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOnce per game, at night*, choose a dead player: they regain their ability until dusk."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Apprentice", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nOn your 1st night, you gain a Townsfolk ability (if good), or a Minion ability (if evil)."],["", {"text": "      "}, {"text": "TRAVELLER", "bold": true, "color": "gray"}, "\n\n", {"text": "Scapegoat", "color": "gray", "underlined": true}, {"text": ":", "color": "gray"}, "\nIf a player of your alignment is executed, you might be executed instead."]],title:"Script Roles",author:""},custom_name=[{"text": "Shoot the Runner Script", "italic": false, "color": "gold", "underlined": true, "bold": true}],lore=[[{"text": "Useful role cheat sheet for ", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}], [{"text": "\"Shoot the Runner\"", "italic": false, "color": "gold"}, {"text": " script.", "italic": false, "color": "gray"}]]]